# Test CI and gated deploy

`azure-pipelines.yml` is test-only and also validates the Databricks bundles. `azure-pipelines-cd.yml` is the only deploy pipeline. It stays manual and gated. Do not dispatch it until `docs/cost-tracker.md` is approved.

GitHub Actions may run tests. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` may use `pull_request` and `push` for `develop`, `ppe`, and `main`. It must not deploy, validate a bundle, call Databricks, or use a `schedule` trigger.

`.github/workflows/cd.yml` stays disabled. Do not remove `if: ${{ false }}` from its jobs. Do not add `pull_request`, `push`, or `schedule` to it. Do not dispatch it.

Do not add `databricks bundle deploy` or `databricks bundle run` to `azure-pipelines.yml` or `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.
